189
00:15:23,950 --> 00:15:29,948
This week: take one real answer from an
AI tool — a meeting recap, a summary of

190
00:15:29,948 --> 00:15:36,170
a public page, a draft reply — and
verify three claims before it borrows
your name.

191
00:15:37,190 --> 00:15:40,590
One that leans on a name, a date, a
number, or a link.

192
00:15:41,290 --> 00:15:45,570
One that could be stale, or from the
wrong country, or the wrong client.

193
00:15:46,350 --> 00:15:51,243
And one you'd be embarrassed to say out
loud if someone asked, "where did that

194
00:15:51,243 --> 00:15:57,190
come from?" You need ten minutes and
enough self-respect not to let Chutney
handle the timeline.

195
00:15:57,890 --> 00:16:03,510
A corkboard and trench coat are
optional... though honestly, that sounds
kind of fun.

196
